        <span>THE THROUGH-LINE</span>
        <h1 id="ab-title">I find the choice<br />hiding in the <em>number.</em></h1>
        <p>I am an economist, teacher, and instrument builder in St. Louis. My research asks what a familiar metric forgot. My teaching asks which mental model broke first. The software gives both questions somewhere to run.</p>
