  <section class="ab-teaching" aria-labelledby="ab-teaching-title">
    <div><span>04 / WHY TEACHING STAYED</span><h2 id="ab-teaching-title">If I cannot explain the step,<br />I may not understand the step.</h2></div>
    <div><p>I have taught or supported instruction at Georgia Tech, Duke University, Indiana University, and online degree programs. The rooms range from principles courses and SAT preparation to graduate econometrics, executive MBA work, engineering signal processing, dissertations, and professional methods training.</p><blockquote>Georgia Tech Graduate Teaching Assistant of the Year · 2023</blockquote></div>
