    <h2 id="ab-dojo-title">Before I taught econometrics,<br />I taught people how to fall.</h2>
    <div><strong>3°</strong><p>I am a third-degree black belt and have taught Sin Moo HapKiDo since 2007. That room taught me to demonstrate precisely, decompose movement, protect the learner while failure is still useful, and remove support as control returns.</p></div>
